  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Somalia Essential Package of Health Services and Health System Strengthening Programme</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity Somalia Essential Package of Health Services and Health System Strengthening Programme is a component of Somali Health and Nutrition Programme (SHINE) 2016-2021 reported by FCDO with a funding type of 104 - Procurement of Services and a budget of &#xa3;21,228,333. It works in the following sector(s): Reproductive health care, Basic nutrition, Basic health care, Health policy and administrative management, Health personnel development, Family planning.</narrative>
  </description>
